      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10047006F006F006D007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pues para no conocerte de nada, parece que\nos lleváis muy bien...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007500650073002000700061007200610020006E006F00200063006F006E006F006300650072007400650020006400650020006E006100640061002C00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065000A006F00730020006C006C0065007600E1006900730020006D007500790020006200690065006E002E002E002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vale, hagamos una cosa. Si es verdad que no es\ntu Goomy, supongo que no te importará<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nenseñarme los Pokémon que llevas hoy, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vamos, que quiero desafiarte a un combate,\nasí los veo de cerca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061006D006F0073002C0020007100750065002000710075006900650072006F002000640065007300610066006900610072007400650020006100200075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002C000A0061007300ED0020006C006F0073002000760065006F002000640065002000630065007200630061002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Combates la mar de bien, eso hay que admitirlo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006200610074006500730020006C00610020006D006100720020006400650020006200690065006E002C002000650073006F00200068006100790020007100750065002000610064006D0069007400690072006C006F002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bueno, ahora es cuando por fin me reconoces\nque el Goomy sí que es tuyo, ¿verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 3144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Goomy! ¡Te he dicho mil veces que no te vayas\ntú solo por ahí!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10047006F006F006D00790021002000A10054006500200068006500200064006900630068006F0020006D0069006C00200076006500630065007300200071007500650020006E006F002000740065002000760061007900610073000A007400FA00200073006F006C006F00200070006F007200200061006800ED002100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Goooo...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F006F006F006F002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Además, es que mira como has dejado el banco...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100640065006D00E10073002C00200065007300200071007500650020006D00690072006100200063006F006D006F0020006800610073002000640065006A00610064006F00200065006C002000620061006E0063006F002E002E002E00100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué limpio ha quedado! ¡Goomy, nos vamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E90020006C0069006D00700069006F0020006800610020007100750065006400610064006F0021002000A10047006F006F006D0079002C0020006E006F0073002000760061006D006F0073002100100002011400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya... Pues era verdad que no era tuyo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002E002E002E002000500075006500730020006500720061002000760065007200640061006400200071007500650020006E006F00200065007200610020007400750079006F002E001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdona, chaval<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀa. Últimamente hay tanto\nPokémon salvaje en la ciudad que me siento<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nobligada a intentar solucionar enseguida<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncualquier problema que me encuentre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 3764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 176
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Como disculpa, permíteme que te dé un consejo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi quieres que Goomy llegue a su evolución final,\ntendrás que usar la lluvia a tu favor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eso es todo, disculpa las molestias.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
